#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:5
#: 286cc97615f04ccd87b16a655207b4e4 b568b2158de843778ea6ce11c2756988
#: d4ccbd5165504b7cb3ba6345e8f42600
msgid "Intel RealSense Depth Camera"
msgstr "Intel RealSense 深度相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:13
#: 3390feabccee47d09e16f3bd671f0d6d 3f90ba55425c4e3eb41702568322eae5
#: 7a8db783c1bf4d69969c9ad784080eb5
msgid ""
"This article explains how to setup an `Intel Realsense Depth Camera "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/stereo-depth/>`__ to be used with ArduPilot "
"for :ref:`obstacle avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`. This "
"method uses a Python script (non `ROS <https://www.ros.org/>`__) running on "
"a companion computer to send distance information to ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何设置 `Intel RealSense 深度相机 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/stereo-"
"depth/>`__ 与 ArduPilot 配合用于 :ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`。该方法使用运行在伴飞计算机上的 Python 脚本（非 `ROS <https://www.ros.org/>`__）向 "
"ArduPilot 发送距离信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:16
#: 199eecd72bfd41218f8471ecf0313c90 82e2ace5df894b86a7f853d3dd7c472e
#: 91fedd7d553947aab6eb85426addd63d
msgid "What to Buy"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:18
#: 2d701c6eee584d5ab1505443ee45ed99 570e5bf118fa44018aaf7173d2e759c1
#: f0b33fdf08fc460cb7cb247659391af7
msgid ""
"`Intel RealSense 435 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d435/>`__ "
"or `D435i <https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d435i/>`__ depth "
"camera.  Other `Intel depth cameras <https://www.intelrealsense.com/stereo-"
"depth/>`__ may also work"
msgstr ""
"`Intel RealSense 435 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d435/>`__ "
"或 `D435i <https://www.intelrealsense.com/depth-camera-d435i/>`__ 深度相机。其他 "
"`Intel 深度相机 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/stereo-depth/>`__ 也可能适用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:19
#: 4b1145b23da947848709818af88a433a 7a0c3362bd4b44658e91f2a02cc01f50
#: cab4759225d344a6a89d912a2906d314
msgid ""
"`UP Squared companion computer <https://up-shop.org/up-squared-"
"series.html>`__ (Celeron 2GB and ATOM are known to work). Other companion "
"computers including the `RPi4 "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-pi-4-model-b/>`__ are not "
"supported although it may be possible to manually set them up (see Configure"
" Companion Computer section below)"
msgstr ""
"`UP Squared 伴飞计算机 <https://up-shop.org/up-squared-series.html>`__ （Celeron "
"2GB 和 ATOM 已验证可用）。其他伴飞计算机（包括 `RPi4 "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-"
"pi-4-model-b/>`__）暂不支持，但可按下方「配置伴飞计算机」章节手动配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:20
#: 855c65d08d244982a773291af7e29fec a506ea766e2948459e98b7b812abd4fd
#: f5085c01a1244495a9b99ba0285260d4
msgid "Two USB flash drives (8GB or more)"
msgstr "两个 USB 闪存驱动器（8GB 或更大）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:23
#: 02e601dc53674c7ea30414bfc5cadcd1 2b22714efca94631b2bb726ebbb29204
#: 9e75a38603e14cc9bc353b93cdfd253d
msgid "Hardware Connections"
msgstr "硬件连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:25
#: 47fe2ea703aa4e8b882cfa5ac62e1404 6ba71b26f0934ca29a7217dd9799568b
#: a011202d9f654a2590efcf5f0b992e77
msgid ""
"Mount the camera on the vehicle facing **forward** (other orientation are "
"not yet supported) and provide isolation from vibrations if possible. "
"Connect the camera USB cable to one of the UP2 board's blue USB3 ports"
msgstr ""
"将相机朝 **前方** 安装在飞行器上（其他方向暂不支持），并尽量做好减震处理。将相机 USB 线连接到 UP2 板的蓝色 USB3 接口之一"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:26
#: 3ce22c41742545a7b399ced5c4583132 68b1e1d6f7f94f59a1f0ddd455514773
#: 93581c6548e741669cadcbb244133900
msgid ""
"Connect the UP Squared's serial port to one of the autopilot's telemetry "
"ports (i.e. Telem1, Telem2) as shown below"
msgstr "将 UP Squared 的串口连接到飞控的某个数传端口（如 Telem1、Telem2），如下所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:33
#: 17c84157c4ed463db178f48bf62aa441 4f7486f9d79a43f4be658484ee2128f1
#: 53c701dbe3064761b2266b06fd9e6f8b
msgid "Setup the UP Squared"
msgstr "设置 UP Squared"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:35
#: 8a3897da94d5426687f355ce008c9b96 cb45b86f347640f48ddf4c3b4fe4d5c7
#: d348afa0562040e3a7fac2727b554161
msgid "Install APSync to the UP Squared:"
msgstr "将 APSync 安装到 UP Squared："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:37
#: 330e08f1c8cb489d8b0929ceff3186cb 706a2b0755cb43a3bddc853988bbfd2f
#: 82bed7cc6aae4ea28406d010a595b3c8
msgid ""
"Download the latest APSync image (`look for apsync-up2-d435i-yyyymmdd.tar.xz"
" here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/beta/>`__) and copy "
"to one of the USB flash drives"
msgstr ""
"下载最新的 APSync 镜像（`在此查找 apsync-up2-d435i-yyyymmdd.tar.xz "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/beta/>`__）并复制到其中一个 USB "
"闪存驱动器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:38
#: 05bd9780e7f847f6858605efd7cf6225 40bd1fef8d1f47ebaa6f939f25a1f8e9
#: 98f3828ceb78469fafa193834ccec9bc
msgid "`Download Tuxboot <https://tuxboot.org/download/>`__"
msgstr "`下载 Tuxboot <https://tuxboot.org/download/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:39
#: 1b9d2801830e4daaa789e6b77b7cd6c7 4ee982d419d3495da7260c43b6b5cf7f
#: a4d16a95c99a44159adf86c632864ef0
msgid ""
"Format a second USB flash drive and use Tuxboot to install `Clonezilla "
"<https://clonezilla.org/>`__ onto it"
msgstr ""
"格式化第二个 USB 闪存驱动器，并使用 Tuxboot 将 `Clonezilla <https://clonezilla.org/>`__ "
"安装到该驱动器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:40
#: 6392da518eb94cd0abc784ebe660164d 868fbab93cee4770ace8a7df7be4d096
#: c44bff029b0343838ffffd764ef0d637
msgid ""
"Insert this second USB flash drive into the UP Squared's USB port and then "
"power up the UP Squared board"
msgstr "将第二个 USB 闪存驱动器插入 UP Squared 的 USB 接口，然后为 UP Squared 板上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:41
