msgstr "选择要恢复的镜像文件，再次按回车"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:58
#: 15a76428e9e249149942891cd4face48 5581f375bc0f4ea9a789cc717976ce7a
#: b405562771584503ba6ccf2dd011a435
msgid ""
"Choose the target disk to be overwritten. Any data on that disk will be "
"overwritten with the APSync image. Press enter"
msgstr "选择要覆盖的目标磁盘。该磁盘上的所有数据将被 APSync 镜像覆盖。按回车"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:59
#: 12ff6966327c4aebbbdcb7db120f9d93 726168547a854e3b950027a71b9e516d
#: f2448bff4edb4fa4bdbc9091c806c067
msgid ""
"Select \"Yes check the image before restoring\" and press enter. This will "
"ensure the image you copied onto USB is healthy."
msgstr "选择「Yes check the image before restoring」并按回车。这将确保复制到 USB 上的镜像文件完好无损。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:60
