#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:65
#: 0d54d4b0913447489b2f63039d1547f7 60872aaa785d4ae8933549359fb650f9
#: f78669780cfc405e83359441352a03a3
msgid ""
"Remove all USB sticks from the board. You can also remove your monitor "
"input."
msgstr "从板上拔下所有 USB 驱动器，也可以拔下显示器连接线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:66
#: 028029d1d156496992e13246f6f1b3b9 665fb1431e254e868328e4451f8b501b
#: 9974aebd207c4993a2037edb0d3d1265
