#: bd1f0480bfa04e6883a9df0d089d8af1
msgid ""
"Check the camera's firmware is version 5.12.8.200 or later.  This can be "
"done using the `Firmware Update Tool (Windows only) "
"<https://dev.intelrealsense.com/docs/firmware-update-tool>`__ or the `Intel "
"Realsense Viewer <https://www.intelrealsense.com/sdk-2/>`__"
msgstr ""
"确认相机固件版本为 5.12.8.200 或更高。可使用 `固件更新工具（仅 Windows） "
"<https://dev.intelrealsense.com/docs/firmware-update-tool>`__ 或 `Intel "
"Realsense Viewer <https://www.intelrealsense.com/sdk-2/>`__ 进行检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:73
#: 015eda54541144ddbe69151356e59781 63819dbc94ee46fb9496ce84f9436aa4
#: 8768dcc506bd41f483eb8067aaa85377
msgid ""
"If using the `Firmware Update Tool "
"<https://dev.intelrealsense.com/docs/firmware-update-tool>`__ the `latest "
"camera firmware can be found here "
"<https://downloadcenter.intel.com/product/128255/Intel-RealSense-Depth-"
"Camera-D435>`__"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 `固件更新工具 <https://dev.intelrealsense.com/docs/firmware-update-"
"tool>`__，`最新相机固件可在此处下载 "
"<https://downloadcenter.intel.com/product/128255/Intel-RealSense-Depth-"
"Camera-D435>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:74
#: 6211c4212af24acf8084902f58521020 c987542af56443e8872ad4b8aed857a9
#: e81b20dfdacc44008d21c00ff2217148
msgid ""
"If using the `Intel RealSense Viewer "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/sdk-2/>`__ after downloading and installing,"
" connect the camera to your PC with a USB3 cable.  The firmware upgrade can "
"be triggered via a pop-up on the top right of the application or from the "
"\"More\" menu as shown below"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 `Intel RealSense Viewer "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/sdk-2/>`__，在下载并安装后，使用 USB3 "
"线将相机连接到电脑。固件升级可通过应用程序右上角的弹窗或「More」菜单触发，如下所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:81
#: 34908c177896405f84ffeaf8c0a53e2e 74010e90352549a1939c3a97736c747e
#: f403641c90c84fdba069e72eb4ecb98e
msgid "Configure ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:83
#: 63a5683f09314644b1906a5e9dd5d593 ea462b98b83a4b2f94599cb770e517fd
#: fa7696bed1604cb3b6646869fbc28183
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) and "
"check that the following parameters are set:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞控，确认以下参数已正确设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:85
#: 61abf42da19947509c2d83ad20326932 9168c983b6a14e87a75df4e7d97a711c
#: b6bd57e767fb4ab791fd5708a697f971
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2).  Note this "
"assumes the companion computer is connected to AutoPilot \"Telem2\" port."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"2（MAVLink2）。注意：此处假设伴飞计算机连接到飞控「Telem2」端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:86
#: 09fd54818c704d44980a3e4e06f74e0e 8786fa32230b4f8cb79d2389306b9465
#: 9b32ce1dd6b84c3a9d4109d2b36454ef
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921 (921600 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921（921600 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:88
#: 477949ca6c63402bae18f360f3887b4d a64b11cb44de438394af14818449f016
#: b8b6e5d37bd44eba9e0d522c19207181
msgid ""
"Enable any of the :ref:`obstacle avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>` of your own choosing. :ref:`Simple avoidance behavior <common-simple-"
"object-avoidance>` (Stop/Slide) will be used as the example for this wiki:"
