#: e4da3034d04f4b2088fa1ccfd7bbe4fb
msgid ""
"To verify that the APSync image is working and everything has been correctly"
" configured ensure ArduPilot is receiving ``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` messages, on"
" Mission Planner: press ``Ctrl+F`` and click on “Mavlink Inspector”, you "
"should be able to see data coming in:"
msgstr ""
"为验证 APSync 镜像正常工作且所有配置正确，请确认 ArduPilot 正在接收 ``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` 消息。在 "
"Mission Planner 中：按 ``Ctrl+F`` 并点击「Mavlink Inspector」，应可看到数据传入："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:120
#: 8515ae39b9194d978c6f7eaf10aa6c52 e2f9bf212b064827b86f46f0a3a64604
#: edcda97944354528a99a6a3cafb46d06
msgid ""
"If you have a stable telemetry connection, the data frequency for "
"``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` message should be close to ``15 hz``. If not, use a "
"USB cable to connect AP and GCS to make sure that the obstacle avoidance "
"data is being received as intended by AP before moving on."
msgstr ""
"在数传连接稳定的情况下，``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` 消息的数据频率应接近 ``15 hz``。若不满足，请使用 USB "
"线连接飞控和地面站，确保避障数据按预期被飞控接收后再继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:122
#: 213ad9a05f4b4c71aae902e210d6c66c 376c4eb858e94c7b9c4749e9136acd52
