msgid ""
"Within Mission Planner, open the ``Proximity view`` (``Ctrl-F`` > "
"``Proximity``):"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中，打开 ``Proximity view`` （``Ctrl-F`` > ``Proximity``）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:124
#: 3f40460a8a674754a0a54815bf80d29c 51414d4bac3243eebc5b05086b7d87cd
#: ec2dc7144c724410b0670457156343ab
msgid ""
"Put the vehicle/depth camera in front of some obstacles, check that the "
"distance to the nearest obstacle is accurate is shown in the Proximity view."
msgstr "将飞行器/深度相机置于障碍物前，检查近距离视图中显示的最近障碍物距离是否准确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:130
#: 29a1ecaecc9443438574d031e456f514 30313ec64661445b9755fa331f03ad82
#: 8c6cad4539e04a12b642275e430f88b7
msgid ""
"The proximity view will group every distances within 45-degrees arc together"
" (in total 8 quadrants around the vehicle), so at most only 3 **nearest** "
"obstacles will be shown at any one time on the Proximity window (since the "
"camera's FOV is less then 90 degrees)."
msgstr ""
"近距离视图会将45度弧范围内的所有距离归为一组（飞行器周围共8个象限），因此在近距离窗口中最多同时显示3个 **最近** "
"障碍物（因为相机视场角小于90度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:133
#: 1e486384941e4c8da5ea5f628b45f622 681154feab1449c6b4c38b1aca66d9a4
#: f56483c3746a40aa92f51e57509e570c
msgid "Flight Test"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:135
#: 47eb5c8920074284adb4991024ed44e1 b04866c92e8046fb91a0ea57557d7aba
#: ee9843d84d044d71afcb9de255453cba
