msgstr "仅轻推飞行器并观察反应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:141
#: 37ee0918e0664e92becdbf9cba56976e 59e04245618f4b37a5d9f67a2c7c2a3e
#: cd42bf641369476f84dad6ea86703111
msgid ""
"Expected behavior: The vehicle should stop/slide (set by ``AVOID_BEHAVE``) "
"at a certain distance away from the obstacle (set by "
"``AVOID_MARGIN/AVOID_DIST_MAX`` depending on the flight mode)."
msgstr ""
"预期行为：飞行器应在距障碍物一定距离处停止/侧滑（由 ``AVOID_BEHAVE`` 设置），该距离由 "
"``AVOID_MARGIN/AVOID_DIST_MAX`` 决定（取决于飞行模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:144
#: 366fc94a2dea463ebbe1802073c0923a 514b34b8d9eb4efc91b67ac1974f6f21
#: 6c121c09ab734aa4a7f082ecfd6d41ca
msgid ""
"If everything works as expected, the next step is to test out the safety "
"margins for your specific sensor/vehicle/environment:"
msgstr "若一切按预期工作，下一步是针对您的具体传感器/飞行器/环境测试安全裕度："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:146
#: 63e7f3e9c3d048f8b7ebceccfe9e54c9 868c2e2b82444a2eb019b1e7fcbfbe3b
#: c517cdd25bc641748e8b76877e960649
msgid ""
"Since the camera has limited FOV and min/max depth range, it is important to"
" test the limits to ensure safety for your vehicle in the actual "
"environment."
msgstr "由于相机具有有限的视场角和最小/最大探测范围，务必测试极限情况以确保飞行器在实际环境中的安全。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:148
#: 558b8b6971304d299152a4fa5189c9ce 60b1e7a661634aa880101c2eed0522a1
#: c3f44d70de8c474a8cc224b06f91d3db
msgid ""
"The pilot should have a rough guess of these margins and put some overheads "
"into the planning of mission."
msgstr "飞手应对这些裕度有粗略估计，并在任务规划中留有余量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:152
#: 170beb2d66e54151a82324f2065c6c1f 2835fe0f4af948adb273a2644508e766
#: f8ddab8ac1804293b36e1c201e6053dd
msgid "Experiments"
msgstr "实验"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:154
#: 2a132c63de9f4a2a99b17dfbb7484939 2b64a1afe6ea4857b16538ab1c3fcbe4
#: 5ffdc43c466e41d9b09f24e00f1bc148
msgid ""
"First manual tests: confirm the expected behavior when obstacle is present, "
"as well as the FOV and safety margins for my vehicle + camera. The flights "
"were conducted in Loiter:"
msgstr "首次手动测试：确认有障碍物时的预期行为，以及我的飞行器和相机的视场角和安全裕度。飞行测试在 Loiter 模式下进行："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:159
#: 2220f592458e4445b7a8d4cc38917d3f d3fc94be12164149b1ef5ab9e0aa958f
#: fa90b9184a8942d8a026658c98da1a25
msgid ""
"Autonomous flight tests: Here is a short video summarizes the main steps "
"during actual experiments and how a working system should behave. In this "
"example, the vehicle will attempt to follow a square pattern but will stop "
"before any obstacle."
msgstr ""
"自主飞行测试：以下是一段简短视频，总结了实际实验的主要步骤以及正常运行系统的行为表现。在本示例中，飞行器将尝试沿正方形路径飞行，但会在遇到任何障碍物前停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:166
#: 178909db6a864e1998f59455a2379e77 cae3503446e04f7d8e522ade8a07e8e3
#: f1369c066c0a4148b4b076114e91f4d8
msgid "DataFlash logging"
msgstr "DataFlash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:168
#: 41bf8678cad942c88138e6a1012f5577 c8ff786ab9864f5ab2599628ea246298
#: ef88208d92a64d83b098236a06bbc664
msgid ""
"The relevant messages for the depth camera are ``PRX.CAn`` and "
"``PRX.CDist``, which stand for angle and distance of the closest object, "
"respectively."
msgstr "深度相机的相关日志消息为 ``PRX.CAn`` 和 ``PRX.CDist``，分别代表最近障碍物的角度和距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:170
#: 1f0fb9db767c4b22b91cfec5bebbab11 9dc71ac8f386436687f2da8c24518955
#: ffe285aeb8ba42cba862de5f267155bc
msgid ""
"You can also view the distance data in each quadrant (D0, D45, and D315 - or"
" 0 degree, 45 degree and 315 degree). Note that the range of value for CAn "
"is 360 degrees while for CDist and the other Dangle only a few meters, so "
"you might need to view them separately."
msgstr ""
"您还可以查看各象限（D0、D45 和 D315，即0度、45度和315度）的距离数据。注意 CAn 的值域范围为360度，而 CDist "
"和其他角度对应的值仅为几米，因此您可能需要分别查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:173
#: 15ff64e1bf6840a3a87772e1675908cf c4e51c2380fb4760bdb5e66acfc0eb1a
#: e66b00ec24544d218673738d6c5abdc3
msgid "System Overview"
msgstr "系统概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:175
#: 15b8fbd00ac742bf8865011178016011 4ebe2bd8393648b69f6a461d6f027d8d
#: e6e2b4eaf5084b11b4ba82a6866fa4d6
msgid ""
"In a nutshell, the script will convert the depth image provided by the "
"Realsense depth camera into distances to obstacles in front. AP supports "
"`DISTANCE_SENSOR "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#DISTANCE_SENSOR>`__ and "
"`OBSTACLE_DISTANCE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#OBSTACLE_DISTANCE>`__ MAVLink "
"messages, with the former carries a single distance and the latter carries "
"an array of distances. ``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` allows us to send up to 72 "
"distances at once, so it will be used."
msgstr ""
"简而言之，该脚本将 Realsense 深度相机提供的深度图像转换为前方障碍物的距离。ArduPilot 支持 `DISTANCE_SENSOR "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#DISTANCE_SENSOR>`__ 和 "
"`OBSTACLE_DISTANCE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#OBSTACLE_DISTANCE>`__ MAVLink "
"消息，前者携带单个距离值，后者携带距离数组。``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` 最多可一次发送72个距离值，因此将使用该消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:177
#: 087f55dc4e024f04a747e32c1408bdac 746cbc1980264f13b6ba22ab0dc07aa8
#: de5b7ae8fbf344bd979a28e790259c08
msgid ""
"Firstly, it is important to apply some form of filters on the **raw** depth "
"image to avoid black holes, noises and generally improve the data to obtain "
"more stable results. Here is full `list of filters "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/post-"
"processing-filters.md>`__ that are included in the script, which you can "
"enable individually. To test the settings for different filters, you can use"
" the `rs-depth-quality "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/tools/depth-"
"quality>`__ example provided by ``librealsense`` or run the example "
"``opencv_depth_filtering.py`` script. The following picture demonstrates the"
" raw (left) and filtered (right) depth image, with the horizontal line as "
"the position where we compute the distances to the obstacles."
msgstr ""
"首先，对 **原始** 深度图像进行某种形式的滤波至关重要，以消除黑洞、噪声，整体改善数据以获得更稳定的结果。脚本中包含了完整的 `滤波器列表 "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/post-"
"processing-filters.md>`__，可单独启用。要测试不同滤波器的设置，可使用 ``librealsense`` 提供的 `rs-"
"depth-quality "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/tools/depth-"
"quality>`__ 示例，或运行示例脚本 "
"``opencv_depth_filtering.py``。下图展示了原始（左）和经过滤波（右）的深度图像，水平线为计算障碍物距离的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:183
#: 6523ab28f3484233bf93f64ca6b03814
msgid ""
"Next, from the input/processed depth image, the distances need to be on the "
"same **horizontal** line (depicted in the right image) since the message "
"contains no field to distinguish different pitch angles. We devide the "
"horizontal field of view of the camera into 72 evenly spaced rays. Along "
"each ray, we select the pixel corresponding to the end of the ray and pick "
"out the depth value."
msgstr ""
"接下来，从输入/处理后的深度图像中，距离需要位于同一 **水平** "
"线上（如右图所示），因为消息中没有区分不同俯仰角的字段。我们将相机的水平视场角划分为72条均匀分布的射线。沿每条射线，选取射线末端对应的像素并读取其深度值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:185
#: 34db28270fef4c5c9b35fc1285359efa 664c9af11f734ddc88982e878fca2243
#: 724ee7780c69491d98e4f9e7acd8a2e1
msgid ""
"Subsequently, the obstacle line will be kept \"fixed\" when the vehicle "
"pitches up and down by compensating for the current pitch of the vehicle "
"which is provided by the `ATTITUDE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATTITUDE>`__  MAVLink message."
msgstr ""
"随后，当飞行器俯仰时，通过补偿由 `ATTITUDE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATTITUDE>`__ MAVLink "
"消息提供的当前俯仰角，障碍物检测线将保持「固定」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:187
#: 16670195140e46c682ca8e19be9f94e0 8eff02abccc54463bf967c11f8de14bb
#: af39062b21f2475ab9dfa08e540164dc
msgid ""
"Finally, the message should be sent at 10Hz or higher, depends on how fast "
"the vehicle is moving."
msgstr "最后，消息应以10Hz或更高的频率发送，具体取决于飞行器的移动速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:191
#: 00ae750fa2ca4f90a5edf540b22cb91a 6a9950f2b79443c0b9e3e8740e36beb0
#: d6869825240844fea6add0721c057a66
