#: 9d5881b803c249ae9b13216f5e9ad464
msgid ""
"These steps are only required if you have not already installed APSync to "
"the companion computer."
msgstr "仅当您尚未在伴飞计算机上安装 APSync 时，才需要执行以下步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:195
#: 492d02abd20e45d6b03b3764491220c4 5e2de3f2d7ac4cdb982f24dc0bc0736d
#: e9517ed13016430382b48243364d76d5
msgid "For the companion computer:"
msgstr "关于伴飞计算机："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:197
#: 45fca853ef13400e972c41acea8252c4 47b5cbbb6b5c4fdc9ea374d6f80e1eac
#: 4dae43fce9f9406dbcfd3451033243db
msgid ""
"**OS**: **Ubuntu 18.04** (highly recommended as this release is the most up-"
"to-date with the required libraries)."
msgstr "**操作系统**：**Ubuntu 18.04** （强烈推荐，该版本与所需库的兼容性最佳）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:198
#: 499d03553b724e8a8bdaa461fe252ed9 75ce9edf052743c18e339e589fd6e721
#: fb652c474d7542ac8a1711a5d4dcee59
msgid ""
"**Python 3.6** and above, which is also the standard for Ubuntu 18.04. Check"
" the version with ``$ python3 -V``, you should see ``Python 3.6.9`` or "
"higher."
